Where:    bibui-raster-managed/src/Rasterizer.cs (Bibui.Raster.Managed).
Licence:  Apache License 2.0 (the same text as LICENSE).
          Copyright 2015 Google Inc.
Source:   https://github.com/raphlinus/font-rs

