5. Tailwind CSS colour palette, and shadcn/ui
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What:     Colour values. ColorRamp's default ramps and the ramps pinned by
          the built-in themes are Tailwind CSS's zinc and violet palettes;
          some status colours are Tailwind palette steps. The neutral-dark
          theme, and the shadow and focus-ring scales of the default
          theme tokens, follow shadcn/ui's.
          The OKLCH lightness of each step a seeded theme's ramps are
          drawn at (Theme.cs) follows Tailwind's: the neutral steps are
          zinc's, and the lighter accent steps match its palette.
Where:    bibui/src/Theming/ColorRamp.cs, bibui/src/Theming/ThemeTokens.cs,
          bibui/src/Theming/Theme.cs, bibui/Assets/Themes/*.json (compiled
          into or embedded in Bibui).
Licence:  MIT.
          Copyright (c) Tailwind Labs, Inc.
          Copyright (c) 2023 shadcn
Source:   https://tailwindcss.com, https://ui.shadcn.com

