9. GLFW key codes and Silk.NET.Input names
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What:     The Key and MouseButton enums take their member names from
          Silk.NET.Input and their values from GLFW's key and button codes;
          the Wayland host's evdev-to-key table is GLFW's table for Wayland,
          so both hosts report the same key.
Where:    bibui/src/Public/InputCodes.cs (Bibui);
          bibui-platform-wayland/KeyTable.cs (Bibui.Platform.Wayland).
Licence:  Silk.NET: MIT.
          Copyright (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors
          GLFW: zlib/libpng licence.
          Copyright (c) 2002-2006 Marcus Geelnard
          Copyright (c) 2006-2019 Camilla Löwy
Source:   https://github.com/dotnet/Silk.NET, https://www.glfw.org

